 "about": "The normalizer of the Romanian diagram world (diagram_ro, and the bilingual diagram_multi): the English table of training/worlds/diagram/normalize.json unchanged, plus the Romanian rules (built by normalize_table.py from lexicon_ro.py). Order: Romanian quotation marks to '\"'; quoted strings become one label token; lower-case; diacritics folded to ASCII; contractions; punctuation split; hyphenated pronoun clitics split; genitive-context phrases; multi-word expressions (longest first); single-word synonyms; number words to digits (tens + 'si' + unit joined; 'one', 'unu', 'una' never); label intro words. The reader never sees the surface forms on the left.",
